      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Go For the Eyes",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Trigger Raskus critically hits with a beak Strike\n\n---\n\nEffect Raskus attempts to peck out his victim's eyes. The target must attempt a DC 29 Fortitude save save.\n\n---\n\nSuccess The target is unaffected.\n\nFailure The target is Blinded for 1 round.\n\nCritical Failure The target is blinded until healed to its maximum Hit Points."
